<section id="S4.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">4.4 </span>Model Analysis and Ablations</h3>

<div id="S4.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S4.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">All ablations use the same data, backbone size, history length, action horizon, optimizer, and training budget unless stated otherwise.
Each comparison controls all variables except the component under study.
We therefore evaluate both generation quality and control performance, since a lower depth loss alone does not show that geometry improves manipulation.
The ten-task split and full ablation metrics are reported in Tab. <a href="#S4.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ 4.4 Model Analysis and Ablations ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ WAM4D: Fast 4D World Action Model via Spatial Register Tokens" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> and Tab. <a href="#S4.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ 4.4 Model Analysis and Ablations ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ WAM4D: Fast 4D World Action Model via Spatial Register Tokens" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<div id="S4.SS4.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S4.SS4.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.SS4.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Ablation split and full metrics.</span></p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.T5" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S4.T5.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 5</span>: </span><span id="S4.T5.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">RoboTwin ten-task split used for model-analysis ablations.</span></figcaption>
<table id="S4.T5.5" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="S4.T5.5.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S4.T5.5.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.1pt 5.0pt;"><span id="S4.T5.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Simulation Task</span></th>
<th id="S4.T5.5.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.1pt 5.0pt;"><span id="S4.T5.5.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Horizon</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S4.T5.5.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T5.5.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding:0.1pt 5.0pt;"><span id="S4.T5.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">Handover Block</span></td>
<td id="S4.T5.5.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding:0.1pt 5.0pt;"><span id="S4.T5.5.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">2</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T5.5.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T5.5.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding:0.1pt 5.0pt;"><span id="S4.T5.5.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">Hanging Mug</span></td>
<td id="S4.T5.5.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding:0.1pt 5.0pt;"><span id="S4.T5.5.3.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">2</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T5.5.4" class="ltx_tr">
